  "summary": {
    "text": "Mistral Small 4 is a mixture-of-experts model from Mistral AI with 119B total parameters, released on 16 March 2026 as Apache 2.0 open weights and on Mistral's API. Mistral describes it as its first model to combine the reasoning, multimodal and agentic coding capabilities of Magistral, Pixtral and Devstral, with reasoning effort set per request.",
